  horseFirstDescription: Juan, the reverse centaur, found purpose after his exile
    in the monastery of Krakovia. There, he trained with monks, mastered the art
    of punching problems away. Big damage, big health bar, medium speed.
  horseImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b41d825f99c61a343bed24ecba8a2352, type: 3}
  fairyFirstDescription: The smartest being in Krakovia, if you don't take into account
    everyone else. A laid-back, very cowardly fairy who attacks from afar with water.
    Deals a lot of damage, fast but fragile.
  fairyImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 19f1d68484e66c841a357fbcd2a5cb03, type: 3}
  skeletonFirstDescription: Skeleton of an average Krakovian, a class not meant for
    the fruity, swings the most sinister ass sword in Krakovia. High damage, HP regen,
    but low health.
  skeletonImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 950f24438b24f414ba38a9291ec3e631, type: 3}
